       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. IBMOODATA.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 OBJECT PIC X(10) VALUE 'A'.
       01 METHOD PIC X(10) VALUE 'B'.
       01 INVOKE PIC X(10) VALUE 'C'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE 'X' TO OBJECT.
           DISPLAY METHOD.
           IF INVOKE = 'C'
               DISPLAY OBJECT
           END-IF.
           STOP RUN.
